<%# An entry opened on its own rather than as a card in a channel.
    This renders the same card the channels render. It used to carry its own copy, which
    had drifted a long way: the plot printed twice, no trailer button, no source badge, no
    Letterboxd controls, no poster picker, and an edit pen that led to a stripped-down form
    instead of the modal every other card opens.
    It also has to be this partial rather than a copy. `update` answers with a turbo_stream
    replacing dom_id(entry) with entries/entry_<media>, so whatever else were here would be
    swapped out for this card on the first save anyway. %>
<div class="container" data-controller="edit">
  <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
    <%= entry_card(@entry) %>
  </div>

  <%# One of each for the page, not one per card -- the same four a channel renders. The
      edit modal has to be inside the data-controller="edit" element to be found. %>
  <%= render 'entries/review_modal_list' %>
  <%= render 'shared/trailer_modal' %>
  <%= render 'shared/poster_selector_modal' %>
  <%= render 'shared/edit_modal' %>
</div>
